TOOLTIP_LEVEL_HIT_TRACE = "Touch Markers\n• Off — no markers.\n• On — retained profiles.\n• On + Focus — also profiles selected by Intraday Focus.\n\nInclude All Anchors\nAlso include anchors outside the current Quick Filter without drawing them.\n\nInclude Older Levels\nAlso include swept levels whose continuation lines are no longer displayed.\n\nLimit Daily Retouches\nRTH and Globex levels mark their first eligible touch after the source profile completes. Later retouches stay quiet, including after the level becomes older. Weekly, Monthly and Quarterly are unchanged.\n\nTouch Marker Labels\nTemporarily show touched identities at the right edge during the selected Window. Existing price settings still apply.\n\nHover notes\n• " + LEVEL_HIT_UNSELECTED_ANCHOR_SYMBOL + " — included through All Anchors.\n• " + LEVEL_HIT_ARCHIVED_SYMBOL + " — included through Older Levels.\n\nMarks the first eligible POC, aPOC, VAH or VAL touch. Up to 1 hour."
TOOLTIP_LEVEL_HIT_WINDOW = "Window\n• ● ● RTH — 05:00–16:00.\n• ● RTH — 08:30–16:00.\n• RTH — 09:30–16:00.\n\nHistory\nHow long markers remain. Session-based assets skip weekends; 24/7 assets count them.\n\nLimit Daily Retouches\nRTH and Globex levels mark their first eligible touch after the source profile completes. Later retouches stay quiet, including after the level becomes older. Weekly, Monthly and Quarterly are unchanged.\n\nFirst Hit\nMarks the earliest cluster in the selected Window. Right edge: " + LEVEL_HIT_FIRST_SYMBOL + " " + LEVEL_HIT_FROM_ABOVE_SYMBOL + "/" + LEVEL_HIT_FROM_BELOW_SYMBOL + ". Hover: " + LEVEL_HIT_FIRST_SYMBOL + " FIRST · From above/below · time."

TOOLTIP_DIM_ROW = "Fade mitigated levels by 85% so untouched levels retain full strength. Only meaningful in Until Touched mode."
